{"name":"Surprise","hex":"#c9936f","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Surprise","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A number of places in the United States:\nA city in Maricopa County, Arizona, the largest place with this name.\nAn unincorporated community in Jackson County, Indiana.\nA village in Butler County, Nebraska.\nA populated place in Greene County, New York.\nFormer name of Surprise Station, California.","A city in Maricopa County, Arizona, the largest place with this name."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Surprise"}],"entries":[{"title":"Surprise","blocks":[{"text":"Surprise is a rapid, fleeting mental and physiological state. It is related to the startle response experienced by animals and humans as the result of an unexpected event."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Charles_Bell%2C_Essays_on_the_anatomy_of_Wellcome_L0031951.jpg/330px-Charles_Bell%2C_Essays_on_the_anatomy_of_Wellcome_L0031951.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Surprise","wikidata":"Q333173"},{"title":"Surprise (Paul Simon album)","blocks":[{"text":"Surprise is the eleventh solo studio album by American musician Paul Simon, released on May 9, 2006. It peaked at number 14 on the Billboard 200 and was his final studio album for long-time label Warner Bros. Records."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c6/Surprise_album_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Surprise_(Paul_Simon_album)","wikidata":"Q2153877"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/STS-51L_riadiace_stredisko.jpg/500px-STS-51L_riadiace_stredisko.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/STS-51L_riadiace_stredisko.jpg/1280px-STS-51